                "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued October 13 at 3:48AM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
                "description": "Observations around the Northern Interior have shown areas of\nmist, flurries and drizzle with temperatures around freezing.\nWith any mist or drizzle Tuesday morning, there is the potential\nfor patchy ice to develop resulting in slick conditions. Please\nuse caution if you are out and about this morning. The risk for\npatchy ice will end this afternoon as temperatures rise above\nfreezing in most spots.",
